# Schedule

The planned calendar for a project, in days or weeks.

◇

attributes:
    - key: day_or_week
      name: Day Or Week
      details: Whether the schedule is recorded by day or by week.
      rules: enum of day, week
      type_spec: STRING

associations:
    - name: Has Weeks
      details: Ordered weeks (or day slots) on this schedule.
      from_multiplicity: "1"
      to_class_key: schedule_week
      to_multiplicity: any
      uniqueness:
          to_attributes:
              - num
